My door is open.
Asha is at the door.
She knocks softly on the door.
There are two cups in her hands.
She comes inside the room.
There is a small table in the living room.
This table is near the sofa.
Asha puts the cups on the table.
Now both cups are placed on the table.
Asha smiles.
She says, "Maya, now we drink tea."
I sit on the sofa.
Asha sits near me.
One of my bags is lying under the table.
We both drink tea.
The tea is very hot and tasty.
There is a lot of peace in the house.
We rest here.
